/E (FAPI and other open banking API security standards do not typically define explicit technical requirements for authentication of the end user, relying on existing mechanisms implemented by the account-holding bank with high-level requirements like the use of multi-factor authentication \(MFA\). However, consumer authentication is a formal requirement of the Section 1033 ruling and is an implied necessity under the OAuth 2.0 authorisation framework. )
