/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Note that, as of this writing, the FDX specification includes fields for Annual Percentage Rate \(APR\) and Annual Percentage Yield \(APY\) as part of the Accounts API, but does not include an API specification for generalized product information or terms and conditions. However, these may be added in the future based on member demands.)
/E (Note that, as of this writing, the FDX specification includes fields for Annual Percentage Rate \(APR\) and Annual Percentage Yield \(APY\) as part of the Accounts API, but does not include an API specification for generalized product information or terms and conditions. However, these may be added in the future based on member demands.)
